"Bti-qwol is an Artonan sixth-year at LeafSong University, studying alien personnel management."
"She coordinates the foreign staff for this year's LeafSong exams."
"She has pale purplish skin and hair and one tattoo, a line from her left eye to her jaw."
"She wears pared-down wizard garb, with no coat and pants a few inches short."
"Her thick silver ring makes a small triangle of light that cuts like a hot knife."
"She summoned Alden Thorn to Artona III for hazardous materials disposal."
"She killed a klerm frog with her light-knife."
"She put Alden on the medical team in place of Pineda to cut costs."
"She wants to eat popular Earth foods before her eighth year."
